## X-Sirus-Update: https://github.com/AmonRay/YUI-Dialogue-Sirus/tree/main
## X-Sirus-Category: 13


## X-GameType: Wrath
# 1.0.8 rebuild: self-contained DUI_C_Timer (C_Timer2 is hidden by SecureCapsule), PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD instead of LOADING_SCREEN_DISABLED; all textures PNG -> uncompressed TGA (3.3.5a cannot load PNG)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 2: XML OnEvent passes `event` explicitly (3.3.5a inline OnEvent is function(self, event, ...), so '...' dropped the event name and the dialog stayed deferred forever)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 3: safety net - the initial-loading guard can no longer swallow NPC interactions after login
# 1.0.8 rebuild 4: OnGamePad* scripts set via DUI_SetScriptSafe (not in 3.3.5a); MuteSoundFile/UnmuteSoundFile stubs
# 1.0.8 rebuild 5: textures -> BLP (uncompressed BGRA, like ElvUI-for-Sirus), 9-slice panel emulation, smooth camera (SaveView/SetView + absolute zoom), IsUnitModelReadyForUI and other missing API, 3.3.5a gossip icons
# 1.0.8 rebuild 6: "Hide UI" works on 3.3.5a - the game interface is hidden while a dialog is open (UIParent:Hide() + SetUIVisibility(false), like Alt+Z)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 7: textures are drawn on 3.3.5a - every BLP now carries a full mip chain (as the uncompressed BLPs of ElvUI-for-Sirus); the release workflow runs scripts/convert_textures_335.py and commits the rebuilt textures
# 1.0.8 rebuild 8: the camera no longer jerks when a dialog closes on 3.3.5a - the game UI comes back first and the camera starts moving back a few frames later (SetView no longer runs in the heavy UIParent:Show() frame); a dialog opened right after another keeps the camera in place


